137 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 45 0 R/E(The American Marketing Association at the University of Puerto Rico \205 Mayag\374ez \(AMA-UPRM\) strives to promote the professional growth of our members by giving them an enriching student experience that will allow them to gain knowledge in the marketing, business administration, and entrepreneurship fields.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

138 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 45 0 R/E(Vision)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

139 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 45 0 R/E(We envision AMA-UPRM as a nationally recognized hub for marketing excellence, a place where driven students evolve into influential leaders by gaining the insight, experience, and network needed to thrive in a constantly evolving industry. Our vision is to cultivate a community where innovation is celebrated, diverse perspectives are amplified, and ambition is met with opportunity. Through sustained engagement with professionals, cutting-edge experiences, and a commitment to empowering every member, we aim to leave a lasting impact.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

