163 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 45 0 R/E(Entering our ninth year since our establishment in 2018, the American Marketing Association at the University of Puerto Rico\205Mayag\374ez continues to represent student leadership, innovation, and excellence. After consistently ranking among the Top Collegiate Chapters globally and achieving a historic Top 20 International recognition, our focus for this academic year is guided by one directive: AMPLIFY. Driven by this momentum, our goals and objectives are to position Puerto Rican student talent at an international standard through practical excellence and continuous growth, elevate AMA-UPRM\220s standing in the American Marketing Association International Chapter Awards by progressing beyond Top 20 recognition to secure a spot among the Top 15 Collegiate Chapters, and prepare members for internships, graduate studies, and successful careers by bridging academic concepts with industry experience. For AMA-UPRM, Amplify means more than increasing visibility; it means elevating the ideas, voices, and potential of our members. This year, our goal is to:)/Pg 12 0 R/K[28]>>
endobj

