<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 49 0 R/E(We strive to create an inclusive environment where every member feels valued, heard, and empowered to contribute their unique voice. By prioritizing mentorship, equitable access to professional certifications, and inclusive leadership development, AMA-UPRM ensures every member finds a place to belong, contribute, and thrive. )/Pg 16 0 R/K[30]>>
