423 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 49 0 R/E(OUR COMMITMENT TO D.E.I)/Pg 16 0 R/K[31]>>
endobj

424 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 49 0 R/E(At AMA-UPRM, our commitment to Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion \(DEI\) is central to our mission, recognizing that innovation thrives on diverse perspectives, backgrounds, and academic disciplines. We amplify this commitment by recruiting beyond traditional business majors, fostering accessibility through initiatives like Sign Language workshops, and engaging in community service that addresses local health, environmental, and educational needs. Through mentorship, equitable access to professional certifications, and inclusive leadership development, AMA-UPRM ensures every member has the opportunity to belong, contribute, and thrive.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[32]>>
endobj

